## 2. Di Mana Pola Repository Ditempatkan?

> **Sepenuhnya di `client/` (Next.js).** Server (NestJS) tidak menggunakan pola ini — ia hanya menyediakan REST API.

Pola ini adalah **client-side abstraction** yang memungkinkan frontend bekerja dengan **data mock** (dummy) ATAU **data real dari backend API** tanpa mengubah kode di komponen/halaman.

---

## 3. Bentuk Interface dan Implementasi Mock

Setiap file di `repositories/` mengikuti pola yang **sangat konsisten** dengan 4 bagian:

### Anatomi Satu File Repository (contoh: [`building.ts`](file:///c:/Peyimpanan%20Pribadi/PROJEK%20BESAR/SmartAlertBuilding/client/src/repositories/building.ts))

```typescript
// ① ENV FLAG — menentukan mock atau real
const useMock = process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_USE_MOCK_DATA !== 'false';

// ② INTERFACE (kontrak) — mendefinisikan method yang tersedia
export interface BuildingRepository {
  getBuildings(): Promise<Building[]>;
  getZones(): Promise<ZoneResponse[]>;
  getFloorPlanData(floorId: string): Promise<FloorPlanData>;
}

// ③ MOCK IMPLEMENTATION — mengembalikan data dummy dari lib/mock/
class MockBuildingRepository implements BuildingRepository {
  async getBuildings(): Promise<Building[]> {
    return mockGedung;   // ← import dari '@/lib/mock/building'
  }
  async getZones(): Promise<ZoneResponse[]> {
    return mockGedung.flatMap((g) => g.floor.flatMap((l) => ...));
  }
  async getFloorPlanData(floorId: string): Promise<FloorPlanData> {
    return { occupancyMap: mockOccupancy, ... };
  }
}

// ④ API IMPLEMENTATION — memanggil backend NestJS via fetch
class ApiBuildingRepository implements BuildingRepository {
  async getBuildings(): Promise<Building[]> {
    return api.get<Building[]>('/api/building');
  }
  async getZones(): Promise<ZoneResponse[]> {
    const res = await api.get<...>('/api/zones');
    return rawList.map(...);  // transform response
  }
  async getFloorPlanData(floorId: string): Promise<FloorPlanData> {
    return api.get<FloorPlanData>(`/api/building/floor-plan/${floorId}`);
  }
}

// ⑤ SINGLETON EXPORT — pilih implementasi berdasarkan env
export const buildingRepository: BuildingRepository = useMock
  ? new MockBuildingRepository()
  : new ApiBuildingRepository();
```

### Peran `lib/mock/*.ts` (Data Layer)

File-file ini **hanya berisi data dummy** — bukan logic. Contoh [`lib/mock/building.ts`](file:///c:/Peyimpanan%20Pribadi/PROJEK%20BESAR/SmartAlertBuilding/client/src/lib/mock/building.ts):

```typescript
export const mockGedung: Building[] = [
  {
    id: 'gedung-1',
    name: 'Gedung Utama BEMS',
    address: 'Politeknik Negeri Malang',
    totalFloors: 5,
    floor: [
      { id: '1', name: 'Lantai 1', zone: [...] },
      // ... 5 lantai, masing-masing punya zona
    ],
  },
];
export const mockOccupancy = { ... };
export const mockDefaultPeakKW = { ... };
```

### Peran `lib/api.ts` (HTTP Layer)

[`api.ts`](file:///c:/Peyimpanan%20Pribadi/PROJEK%20BESAR/SmartAlertBuilding/client/src/lib/api.ts) adalah **generic HTTP client** berbasis `fetch`:

```typescript
export const api = {
  get:    <T>(path, options?) => apiFetch<T>(path, { method: 'GET', ...options }),
  post:   <T>(path, body?, options?) => apiFetch<T>(path, { method: 'POST', body, ...options }),
  put:    <T>(path, body?, options?) => apiFetch<T>(path, { method: 'PUT', body, ...options }),
  patch:  <T>(path, body?, options?) => apiFetch<T>(path, { method: 'PATCH', body, ...options }),
  delete: <T>(path, options?) => apiFetch<T>(path, { method: 'DELETE', ...options }),
};
```

Fitur utama:
- Auto-attach `Bearer` token dari cookie
- Error handling (401, 502/503/504, 5xx) dengan pesan bahasa Indonesia
- URL resolusi: SSR → `API_BASE_URL` (Docker hostname), CSR → `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL` (relative/empty)

