## 4. Bagaimana Komponen/Halaman Mengonsumsi Data

### Pola Konsumsi: **Import langsung dari barrel `@/repositories`**

Tidak ada custom hook atau dependency injection framework. Komponen **langsung import singleton** dan panggil di `useEffect`:

```typescript
// file: app/(main)/dashboard/page.tsx
import { buildingRepository, energyRepository, alertRepository } from '@/repositories';

export default function DashboardPage() {
  const [zones, setZones] = useState<ZoneResponse[]>([]);

  useEffect(() => {
    async function initDashboard() {
      const fetchedZones = await buildingRepository.getZones();
      setZones(fetchedZones);

      const fetchedAlerts = await alertRepository.getAlerts().catch(() => []);
      setAlerts(fetchedAlerts);

      // Parallel fetching
      const [intensity, weekly, zonePerf, clusters, health, ...] = await Promise.all([
        energyRepository.getEnergyIntensity().catch(() => []),
        energyRepository.getWeeklyComparison().catch(() => []),
        energyRepository.getZonePerformance().catch(() => []),
        // ... dst
      ]);
    }
    initDashboard();
  }, []);
}
```

### Siapa Saja yang Mengonsumsi Repositories?

| Repository | Dipakai oleh |
|---|---|
| `buildingRepository` | Dashboard, Energy Map, Zone Details, Floor Plan |
| `energyRepository` | Dashboard, Energy Map, Zone Details, Energy Metrics Mgmt |
| `alertRepository` | Dashboard, Alert page, Header (notifikasi), Zone Details |
| `settingsRepository` | Settings page |
| `userRepository` | Profile, User Management |
| `reportRepository` | Reports page |
| `analyticsRepository` | Efficiency Analytics |
| `zoneRepository` | Zone Management, Device Management |
| `ruleRepository` | Rules Management |
| `deviceRepository` | Device Management |

