## 6. Docker Compose — Services yang Terlibat

| Service | Image | Profil | Fungsi |
|---|---|---|---|
| `db` | `timescale/timescaledb:2.29.0-pg16` | always | Database utama (PostgreSQL + TimescaleDB) |
| `mosquitto` | custom build | always | MQTT broker untuk IoT devices |
| `server` | custom build (NestJS) | `dev` | Backend API (:3001), hot-reload |
| `server-prod` | `bems-server:latest` | `prod` | Backend API produksi |
| `client-prod` | `bems-client:latest` | `prod` | Frontend Next.js standalone |
| `tunnel` / `tunnel-prod` | `cloudflare/cloudflared` | dev/prod | Cloudflare Tunnel |
| `gateway` | NGINX | `prod` | Reverse proxy (port 80/443) |

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Tidak ada service cache (Redis, dll). Arsitekturnya **cukup sederhana**: Client → Server → DB + MQTT.

